@startuml
[*] --> ViewingTasks
[*] --> ImportingTasks

ViewingTasks --> AddingTask : Add Task
ViewingTasks --> UpdatingTask : Update Task
ViewingTasks --> DeletingTask : Delete Task

AddingTask --> SuggestingTasks : Suggest Tasks
AddingTask --> ShowingSummary : Show Summary

UpdatingTask --> SuggestingTasks : Suggest Tasks
UpdatingTask --> ShowingSummary : Show Summary

DeletingTask --> SuggestingTasks : Suggest Tasks
DeletingTask --> ShowingSummary : Show Summary

ImportingTasks --> SuggestingTasks : Suggest Tasks
ImportingTasks --> ShowingSummary : Show Summary

SuggestingTasks --> ViewingTasks : Return to View
SuggestingTasks --> ImportingTasks : Return to Import

ShowingSummary --> ViewingTasks : Return to View
ShowingSummary --> ImportingTasks : Return to Import

ViewingTasks --> [*]
ImportingTasks --> [*]
@enduml
